  "note": "Mexico surfaces the measurement half plus the authorisation and the fiscal document, because here the invoice is not a letter you write, it is a CFDI the tax authority stamps, and it has to agree with the estimacion it is raised against. The amortizacion del anticipo rides on the adjust step, which is what a spine slot for the money held back from each payment is for.",
  "slug": "authorise-the-estimacion-and-invoice-it-as-a-cfdi",
